# Normalize every text file to LF both in the repository and in working trees on
# all platforms. Content hashes are part of the system's contract: the coverage
# baseline (DOCS/coverage-baseline.json) and the adapter manifest
# (.opencode/adapter-manifest.json) hash file bytes, so mixed line endings would
# make `se doctor` / `se validate` fail on a fresh clone. Binaries are detected
# automatically by `text=auto` and never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
